# Downloaded DeepSeek-V4-Flash weights and the emulation golden it produces.
# scripts/download_dsv4_layer0.sh fetches multi-gigabyte shards here, and
# apps/dsv4_layer0_emu_bench writes golden_layer0_ref.bin beside them; none of
# it belongs in the source tree.
data/

# Isolated arch35 kernel fixtures: ~50 MiB of weight and activation slices,
# regenerated on demand by apps/dsv4_extract_kernel_fixtures.
data/dsv4_layer0/kernel_fixtures/

# Device-compile gate output (scripts/device_compile_kernels.sh)
build_dav3510/

# dav-3510 CAModel run output, written into the working directory by the
# simulator and the driver stub on every ctest of a `camodel`-labelled gate.
# `instr.bin` is an append-only instruction trace that reached 17 MB over three
# runs; `stars_log*.dump` is the STARS task log and `excp_log*.dump` the
# exception dumps the sim fixtures census after a launch. All three were
# tracked by accident and carry no information about the source -- a diff of
# them says only that someone ran the simulator.
instr.bin
stars_log*.dump
excp_log*.dump
log_ca/
